RandomPoints -- Obtain random points in a variety
*************************************************

Description
===========

RandomPointsFind random points inside a variety.

This package provides tools for quickly finding a point (rational, or over a
field extension) in the vanishing set of an ideal.  The search is highly
customizable.  This package also includes tools for finding submatrices of a
given rank at some point.  Furthermore, it provides tools for generic
projections and producing collections of linear forms with specified
properties.
Core functions:
  * *note randomPoints: randomPoints,:  This tries to find a point in the
    vanishing set of an ideal.
  * *note findANonZeroMinor: findANonZeroMinor,:  This finds a submatrix of a
    given matrix that is nonsingular at a point of a given ideal.
  * *note extendIdealByNonZeroMinor: extendIdealByNonZeroMinor,:  This extends
    an ideal by a minor produced by *note findANonZeroMinor:
    findANonZeroMinor,.
  * *note projectionToHypersurface: projectionToHypersurface, and *note
    genericProjection: genericProjection,:  These functions provide
    customizable projection.


